## 四、關鍵功能實現（Core Features Implementation）

### 1️⃣ 鑰匙概念：全域 Provider

#### `contexts/AuthProvider.tsx`

```tsx
import { createContext, useState, useEffect } from 'react';
import { getTokenFromLocalStorage, setTokenToLocalStorage, removeToken } from '../utils/auth';

export const AuthContext = createContext(null);

const AuthProvider = ({ children }) => {
  const [token, setToken] = useState<string|null>(null);
  const [isAuthenticated, setIsAuthenticated] = useState(false);

  useEffect(() => {
    const storedToken = getTokenFromLocalStorage();
    if(storedToken) {
      setToken(storedToken);
      setIsAuthenticated(true);
    }
  }, []);

  const login = async (email:string,password:string)=>{ /* call API */ };
  const logout = () =>{
    removeToken(); 
    setToken(null); 
    setIsAuthenticated(false);
  };

  return (
    <AuthContext.Provider value={{ token,isAuthenticated,login,logout }}>
      {children}
    </AuthContext.Provider>
  );
};

export default AuthProvider;
```

同理，你也會創建 `CartProvider`，負責儲存商品陣列、總金額、折扣碼等等。

### 2️⃣ API Client (`lib/apiClient.ts`)

```ts
import axios from 'axios';
import { getTokenFromLocalStorage } from './auth';

const apiClient = axios.create({
  baseURL: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL || '/api',
});

apiClient.interceptors.request.use((config)=>{
  const token = getTokenFromLocalStorage();
  if(token){
    config.headers.Authorization = `Bearer ${token}`;
  }
  return config;
},(error)=>Promise.reject(error));

apiClient.interceptors.response.use(
  response=>response.data,
  async err=>{
    if(err?.response?.status===401){/* auto logout logic */}
    return Promise.reject(err);
  });

export default apiClient;
```

### 3️⃣ 商品展示 – Grid + 卡片

#### `components/product/ProductCard.tsx`

```tsx
import Link from 'next/link';
import Image from 'next/image';
import { formatPrice } from '../../utils/helpers';

interface Props{
  id:number|string;
  title:string;
  price:number;
  imageUrl:string;
}

const ProductCard=({id,title,price,imageUrl}:Props)=><Link href={`/products/${id}`}>
  <a className="block border rounded hover:border-indigo-500 transition-colors">
    <Image src={imageUrl} alt={title} width={300} height={200}/>
    <div className="p-4 flex justify-between items-center">
      <h3>{title}</h3>
      <span>{formatPrice(price)}</span>
    </div>
  </a>
</Link>;

export default ProductCard;
```

#### `components/product/ProductGrid.tsx`

```tsx
import { useProducts } from '../../hooks/useProducts';
import ProductCard from './ProductCard';

const ProductGrid=()=>{

  const {data:products,error}=useProducts();

  if(error)return <p>載入失敗…請稍候。</p>;
  if(!products)return <p>正在搜尋...</p>;

  return (
    <section className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 p-4">
      {products.map(p=>(<ProductCard key={p.id} {...p}/>))}
    </section>);
};
export default ProductGrid;
```

### 4️⃣ 購物車邏輯

#### `hooks/useCart.ts`

```ts
import { useContext } from 'react';
import { CartContext } from '../contexts/CartProvider';

export const useCart = ()=>{
  const ctx = useContext(CartContext);
  if (!ctx) throw new Error('useCart 必須被 CartProvider 包裹');
  return ctx;
};
```

#### 在 `cart.tsx` 中顯示內容

```tsx
import { useCart } from '@/hooks/useCart';
import { formatPrice } from '@/utils/helpers';

const CartPage=()=>{
  const {items,total,removeItem,updateQty}=useCart();

  return (<main className='container mx-auto py-8'>
    <h1 className='text-xl font-bold mb-4'>您的購物車</h1>

    {!items.length && <p>空空如也！去挑幾款好貨吧～</p>}

    {items.map(item=>(
      <article key={item.productId} className='flex items-center space-x-4 pb-4 border-b last:border-none'>
        {/* ...圖片、名稱、價格... */}
        <input type='number' min={1} max={99} value={item.qty}
               onChange={(e)=>updateQty(item.productId,+e.target.value)} />
        <button onClick={()=>removeItem(item.productId)}>移除</button>
      </article>
    ))}

    <footer className='pt-4 text-right'>
      <strong>共計：</strong>{formatPrice(total)}
    </footer>
  </main>);
};
export default CartPage;
```

### 5️⃣ 結帳流程

1. **地址填寫** → 表單驗證（HTML5 + Yup）
2. **付款** → Stripe Elements（client secret 從後端取得）
3. **訂單確認** → POST `/orders/create`，成功則跳至 Thank You 頁面

#### `checkout.tsx`

```tsx
import { loadStripe } from '@stripe/stripe-js';
import { Elements, PaymentElement, useElements, useStripe } from '@stripe/react-stripe-js';
import { useForm } from 'react-hook-form';
import { yupResolver } from "@hookform/resolvers/yup";
import * as yup from 'yup';

// schema
const schema=yup.object().shape({
  name:yup.string().required(),
  address:yup.string().required()
});

// main component
function Checkout(){
  const stripe=useStripe(),elements=useElements();
  const {register,setError,onSubmit,errors}=useForm({resolver:yupResolver(schema)});
  const handlePayment=(async(data:any)=>{
    const res=await fetch('/api/payment', {method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({...data,address:data.address,name:data.name})});
    const result=await res.json();
    if(result.error)setError("payment","server",result.message);
    else window.location.href=`/thank-you?id=${result.order_id}`
  });
  return (
    <form onSubmit={handleSubmit(handlePayment)}>
      <label>Name<input {...register('name')} /></label>
      <label>Address<textarea {...register('address')}/></label>
      <PaymentElement/>
      <button disabled={!stripe||!elements}>Pay Now</button>
    </form>)
}

// wrap with Elements
export default ()=>(
  <Elements stripe={loadStripe(process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE!)}>
    <Checkout/>
  </Elements>
)
```

> 💡 注意：不要把 Secret Key 放在前端，只要 Publishable Key 就 OK。

